# Gradle / Android build output.
#
# Nothing under here is source. In particular the APK is never committed: it
# is produced by CI and attached to a release, so a stale binary in the tree
# could only ever disagree with the code that built it.
.gradle/
build/
app/build/
app/release/
local.properties

# CI scratch
build.log
failure-report.md
notes.md
prism-*-debug.apk

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
.DS_Store

# Kotlin
.kotlin/
report.md
screenshots/
offscript-*.apk
SHA256SUMS.txt
